			"notes": "# Official Release 1.0.4\n\n## Changelog\n\n### 🚀 New Features & Blocks\n* **Steel Equipment:** Added a full set of Steel tools and armors.\n* **SpeedBox & JumpBox:** Introduced the functional SpeedBox blocks to boost your mobility.\n* **Cherry Trees:** Added the Cherry Tree (`iyc:cherry_sapling`) along with its potted variant.\n\n### 📜 Recipe Changes\n* **Jumpbox/Speedbox:** Added dedicated crafting recipes for both the Jumpbox and the Speedbox.\n* **Obsidian Tier:** Overhauled and changed the recipes for the Obsidian ingot, Obsidian blocks, and Obsidian armors.\n* **Campfire:** Adjusted and changed the recipe for the campfire (`iyc:fire_camp`).\n\n### ⚖️ Balance & Loot Tables\n* **Ore Generation:** Rebalanced ore generation across the world for a smoother mining experience.\n* **Stone Drop:** Balanced the global `stone` loot table.\n* **Agriculture & Gathering:** Added a chance to get hop seeds (`iyc:hops_seeds`) when breaking `short_grass` and `tall_grass`.\n\n---\n\n- **Loader:** NeoForge 1.21.1 (21.1.216)\n\nThis mod is a complete rebirth of the original \"Imagine Your Craft\" mod initially created in 2012. It has been entirely rebuilt from scratch to be compatible with NeoForge 1.21.1, bringing the classic experience back to life with better performance and stability.\n\nIf you encounter any issues or have feedback, feel free to contact **Stylobow** on Discord!"
		},
