			"notes": "# Official Release 1.0.3\n\n## Changelog\n\n### 🛠️ Fixes & Adjustments\n* **Keystrokes Overlay:** Fixed a visual bug where mouse clicks (left/right) remained stuck in the pressed state when opening screens, containers, or the pause menu.\n* **Cloud Effect Generator:** Changed the generated particle type from the custom ones to `minecraft:poof`.\n\n### 📦 Gameplay & Blocks Changes\n* **Beacon Base:** Colored iron blocks can now properly power and act as a valid base for Beacons.\n* **Hidden Door:** The hidden door now seamlessly handles and displays the custom colors of the mod's colored iron blocks.\n* **IYC Radio:** The radio system now correctly plays the custom music tracks included directly within the mod files.\n\n---\n\n- **Loader:** NeoForge 1.21.1 (21.1.216)\n\nThis mod is a complete rebirth of the original \"Imagine Your Craft\" mod initially created in 2012. It has been entirely rebuilt from scratch to be compatible with NeoForge 1.21.1, bringing the classic experience back to life with better performance and stability.\n\nIf you encounter any issues or have feedback, feel free to contact **Stylobow** on Discord!"
