			"notes": "# Official Release 1.0.2\n\n## Changelog\n\n### 🛠️ Fixes & Adjustments\n* **Block Visibility:** Fixed a visual bug that allowed players to see through half-blocks or hidden faces with custom slopes.\n* **Creative Inventory:** Reordered `iyc:mangrove_shelf` and `iyc:cherry_shelf` inside the Creative Tab for better organization.\n* **Textures:** Fixed rendering and texturing layout issues on slopes.\n* **Collisions:** Patched the `CollisionBox` properties specifically for the `LampBlock`.\n\n### 📦 Gameplay & Blocks Changes\n* **New Blocks:** Added the block `iyc:hidden_door` and a brand new `Nuke` block.\n* **Block Improvements:** Improved the logic and functionality of the custom `iyc:iron_ladder`.\n* **Removals:** Completely removed `iyc:rainbow_iron_block` due to internal performance drops and lack of gameplay relevance.\n\n### 🎨 Cosmetics\n* **Legacy Skin Compatibility:** The skin system now seamlessly handles the classic or legacy format alongside the modern system. Characters utilizing these older layouts will no longer encounter missing arms or legs during multiplayer synchronization.\n\n---\n\n- **Loader:** NeoForge 1.21.1 (21.1.216)\n\nThis mod is a complete rebirth of the original \"Imagine Your Craft\" mod initially created in 2012. It has been entirely rebuilt from scratch to be compatible with NeoForge 1.21.1, bringing the classic experience back to life with better performance and stability.\n\nIf you encounter any issues or have feedback, feel free to contact **Stylobow** on Discord!"
		},
