			"notes": "# Official Release 1.0.1\n\nThis update brings several bug fixes, block adjustments, and the highly anticipated completion of the custom cosmetic synchronization system.\n\n## Changelog\n\n### 🛠️ Fixes & Adjustments\n* **Iron Bars:** Fixed rendering issues associated with iron bars.\n* **Block Collisions:** Removed collisions on CTF blocks.\n* **Textures:** Updated the texture for `iyc:sandstone_slopes`.\n\n### 📦 Gameplay & Blocks Changes\n* **Light Block:** The `iyc:transparent_light_block` now functions properly as a barrier block.\n* **Crafting:** Modified the crafting recipe for **Clouds**.\n\n### 🎨 Cosmetics\n* **Skin Synchronization:** Custom skins and capes are now fully working and visible between players. This includes full support for large and HD custom textures without network issues.\n\n---\n\n- **Loader:** NeoForge 1.21.1 (21.1.216)\n\nThis mod is a complete rebirth of the original \"Imagine Your Craft\" mod initially created in 2012. It has been entirely rebuilt from scratch to be compatible with NeoForge 1.21.1, bringing the classic experience back to life with better performance and stability.\n\nIf you encounter any issues or have feedback, feel free to contact **Stylobow** on Discord!"
