			"notes": "# First Official Release\n\nThis is the first stable and playable version of **Imagine Your Craft**.\n\nThis mod is a complete rebirth of the original \"Imagine Your Craft\" mod initially created in 2012. It has been entirely rebuilt from scratch to be compatible with **NeoForge 1.21.1**, bringing the classic experience back to life with better performance and stability.\n\n- **Loader:** NeoForge 1.21.1 (21.1.216)\n\nIf you encounter any issues or have feedback, feel free to contact **Stylobow** on Discord!"
		}
